From 91c30a8ca727a63f6cdeb05667d77246d76ad162 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ma Wupeng <mawupeng1@huawei.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:55:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH OLK-6.6 v5 18/18] openeuler: configs: arm64: Enable PBHA by
 default

hulk inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: https://atomgit.com/openeuler/kernel/issues/9826

--------------------------------

Enable feature PBHA for arm64 by default.

Signed-off-by: Ma Wupeng <mawupeng1@huawei.com>
Signed-off-by: Fanhua Li <lifanhua5@huawei.com>
Signed-off-by: Jiacheng Yu <yujiacheng3@huawei.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/openeuler_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/openeuler_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/openeuler_defconfig
index 007158aed18e..7a93e398be06 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/openeuler_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/openeuler_defconfig
@@ -560,6 +560,7 @@ CONFIG_ARM64_USE_LSE_ATOMICS=y
 CONFIG_ARM64_PMEM=y
 CONFIG_ARM64_RAS_EXTN=y
 CONFIG_ARM64_CNP=y
+CONFIG_ARM64_PBHA=y
 # end of ARMv8.2 architectural features
 
